{
  "policy_id": "fpbench_research_only_third_party_v1",
  "policy_version": "1",
  "statement": "Third-party licensing does not block local personal educational research execution merely because commercial use, redistribution, sublicensing or publication is restricted. Upstream rights are recorded faithfully and separately from the decision to execute. fpbench redistributes no third-party bytes. Legal ambiguity stays visible and may be explicitly risk-accepted for local research instead of silently becoming an engineering blocker.",
